                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【Live Audios (lossless)】WAV - Chappell Roan + Hemlocke Springs @ Brookside Park 2025-10-11]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/chappell-roan-hemlocke-springs-brookside-park-2025-10-11.286093/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					Chappell Roan + Hemlocke Springs @ Brookside Park, Pasadena, CA 2025-10-11<br>
<br>
Raw Waves<br>
<br>




<div class="bbCodeBlock bbCodeVfcHH HiddenContent">
	<div class="attribution type">Hidden Content:</div>
	<blockquote>You must either reply or click 'Like' to see the hidden information contained here.</blockquote>
</div><br>
<br>
Was thinking Friday only because Saturday would theoretically be a tougher ticket but ended up at Mates Of State. Then I went for the easiest and laziest option, a classical piano recital at a local library. But after 20 minutes of a camera click click click in my right ear by a painfully self unaware geezer I bailed and came here and ended up finding a free ticket in a few minutes.<br>
<br>
Fun to hang out and people watch either way. The only other musical act (I think) was Hemlocke Springs which was pretty good. People around me were really excited and noisy early on but I was in a good spot and it might not have intruded too much on the recording, which I heard about a combined 6 seconds of in 3 different spots.<br>
<br>
Enjoy!
